          <section id="definition" class="mb-16" data-reveal>
            <h2 class="mb-6 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">
              What is GaaS (Agentic as a Service)?
            </h2>

            {# Featured Definition Box - AEO Optimized #}
            <div class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#76B900]/20 bg-[#76B900]/[0.06] p-6">
              <span class="mb-3 block font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[#4a7a00]">Definition</span>
              <p class="mb-0 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-navy-900">
                <strong class="font-semibold">Agentic as a Service (GaaS)</strong> is a cloud delivery model where autonomous AI agents are provided as managed services. Instead of using software tools yourself, you delegate tasks to AI agents that independently plan, execute, and deliver results—much like hiring a capable employee who figures out how to accomplish goals without step-by-step instructions.
              </p>
            </div>

            <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-navy-400">
              The term "GaaS" was coined to describe the next evolution beyond SaaS (Software as a Service). While SaaS gives you <em>tools to use</em>, GaaS gives you <em>agents that work</em>.
            </p>

            <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-navy-400">
              Think of it this way: SaaS is like buying a hammer. GaaS is like hiring a carpenter. You don't need to learn how to use the hammer—you just describe what you want built.
            </p>

            {# Simple Analogy Box #}
            <div class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/60 via-sky-50/25 to-white/50 p-6 shadow-subtle backdrop-blur-sm">
              <h3 class="mb-4 text-[18px] font-medium text-[#111827]">The Simple Explanation</h3>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <p class="mb-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-400">SaaS (Old Way)</p>
                  <p class="text-[14px] text-navy-400">"Here's a spreadsheet tool. Learn it, use it, do the work yourself."</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="mb-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[#4a7a00]">GaaS (New Way)</p>
                  <p class="text-[14px] text-navy-400">"Tell me what analysis you need. I'll gather the data, run the numbers, and deliver a report."</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

